/P 46 0 R
/E (Existing manual or partially digitized rental workflows make it difficult to determine vehicle availability in real time, often resulting in double bookings, delayed responses to customer requests, and inconsistent rental pricing. Fleet-related information such as vehicle condition, servicing history, and maintenance schedules is frequently maintained separately from booking records, increasing the risk of assigning a vehicle that is due for maintenance. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
